PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS
TRU PU is water-based, single-component, bitumen-modiﬁed, liquid applied, polyurethane waterprooﬁng membrane. It
comes with excellent waterprooﬁng properties, excellent elongation and good hydrostatic pressure resistance. Tru PU is
single-component, hence easy to apply.
