CLEANING
Use tap water for cleaning tools & tackles.
HANDLING PRECAUTIONS
Mandatory and recommended industrial hygiene procedures should be followed whenever our products are being handled
and processed. For additional information please refer MSDS.
STORAGE
Ÿ | Product should be stored in a dry place in its original, properly closed
Ÿ | container at temperatures between 2-40°C.
Ÿ | Partially emptied container should be closed immediately.
COVERAGE
Ÿ | 21.1 - 1.2 kg/m / 2 coats (minimum 2 coats recommended)
Ÿ | Coverage depends on the type of substrate and its porosity.
SHELF LIFE
24 months from the date of manufacturing
